          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "It’s a dark and stormy night when the camp huddles into the mess hall for an indoor evening activity - Werewolf! The role playing game transforms campers into “villagers” with “werewolves” hidden in their midst. The randomly assigned villagers have to figure out who the designated werewolves are, lest the werewolves “devour” the village and win. The Hoot staff is just getting into the game when the lights go out. When they come back on, five counselors are discovered to be missing. The Hoot staff snaps into action when clues suggest the counselors are in trouble!\n",
